    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n114053" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χῐον-ίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>snow upon, cover with snow</i>: impers., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰ ἐχιόνιζε . . τὴν χώρην</span> [sc.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ θεός</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.22
			</span></i>: abs., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰ ἐχιόνιζε</span> if
				<i>it snowed,</i> ibid.:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be covered with snow,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				1.39
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sm.
				<u>Ps.</u>
				67(68).15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.61
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				6.23
			</span></i> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεχιονωμένους</span>
			), Sch. <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				4.269
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
